    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63040" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐβᾰν-ωτίς</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rosemary frankincense</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ.
